<mxCell id="c189" value="Role harian operasional dipilih SPV di sistem ini: Picker, Checker, Packer, Driver (outbound), Inbound (unloading, GR, put away), Storage Control, Admin Inbound, Admin Outbound, Admin ganda (saat rekan cuti / off).&lt;br&gt;PPIC, HRD, Finance: akses terbatas sesuai fungsi (SOQ, master karyawan dan cuti, file HPP)." style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#595959;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1000" width="980" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
